// 2024-03-05T10:11:12[UTC] -> 2024-03-05T10:11:12Z[UTC] 1709633472
// 2024-03-05T10:11:12+09:00[+09:00] -> 2024-03-05T10:11:12+09:00[+09:00] 1709601072
// +012024-03-05T10:11:12Z -> +012024-03-05T10:11:12Z[UTC] 317279153472
// -000001-12-31T23:59:59Z -> -000001-12-31T23:59:59Z[UTC] -62167219201
// 2822 2024-03-05T10:11:12+09:00 Tue, 05 Mar 2024 10:11:12 +0900
