// http 1994-11-06T08:49:37Z Sun, 06 Nov 1994 08:49:37 GMT
// http 1994-11-06T08:49:37Z Sun, 06 Nov 1994 08:49:37 GMT
// error: cannot parse "2024-3-05": expected a two-digit month (`01`..`12`) at byte 6, found `-` [6]
// error: cannot parse "24-03-05": expected a four-digit year (`2024`) at byte 2, found `-` [2]
// error: cannot parse "2024-03-05x": expected the end of the text at byte 10, found `x` [10]
// error: cannot parse "-000000-01-01": year -000000 is not allowed at byte 0; write `+000000` or `0000` [0]
// error: cannot parse "2024-02-30": day 30 is out of range for 2024-02 (1..=29) at byte 8 [8]
// error: cannot parse "+1234-01-01": expected a six-digit year after the sign (`+012345`) at byte 5, found `-` [5]
// error: cannot parse "": expected a four-digit year (`2024`) at byte 0, found the end of the text [0]
